From 7a4a11de03b79953e5bb28a4eee3ed09a7b2e9fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 01:10:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 20/51] begonia-wifi (fwport-gen4m): scaffold CONNAC/AXI/6785
 subset + build wiring

Copy the gen4m fullmac WLAN driver (vendor 4.14) into
drivers/misc/mediatek/connectivity/wlan/gen4m, scoped to the begonia
config (MTK_COMBO_CHIP=CONNAC, HIF=axi, WLAN_CHIP_ID=6785, IP_SET=2,
ECO=1, ANDROID_WMT/EMI=y) -> 93 TU object list. Mirrors the Stage-1
pattern: custom Makefile dropping all BSP -I paths, internal include
dirs + the shared compat/include shim force-included, scoped object
list. New CONFIG_MTK_WLAN_GEN4M (depends on MTK_WMT_DRV + CFG80211).
No build yet; deriving the error surface next.

Signed-off-by: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
